Translate Extension has been tuned up (ki'e entot !).

Using this extension you can translate the content of any page into other 
languages.
If we ever move the CLL, Wave lessons and L4B to this wiki you will be able 
to translate them chunk by chunk to other languages that you speak.
Note that if the source is changed the extension notices this and inform 
that the translation to another language is out of date.
This is how we can put speakers  of all languages (not only English) in 
equal conditions when learning Lojban.


